name: Brainstorm — copy leftmost
author: corpus
description: >-
  Brainstorm copies the ability of the leftmost Joker. First-shop copy engine: place the
  strongest effect in the leftmost slot (Cavendish, The Order, Baron, Perkeo).
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - joker: Brainstorm
    antes: [1]
    sources:
      shopItems: [0, 1, 2, 3]
      boosterPacks: [0, 1]
should:
  - joker: Cavendish
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 45
  - joker: TheOrder
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 40
  - joker: Baron
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 35
